armada manifest — one repository's stack: ports, services, checks

VERBS
  config  report the evidence, then verify what was written
  init    claim this workspace: ports, .armada/, setup
  status  what is running, what is mine, what is stale
  check   lint, format and test — the verb a gate calls
  clean   release what this workspace owns

NOT BUILT YET
  up, down, skills, render, agents-md, explain  reserved; see PHASES.md §8

`armada manifest <verb> --help` for one verb's flags.
